    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think of it as a first-person psychological horror game with a silly twist. After getting fired and signing a new contract, you're plunged into a crazy experiment where reality blurs with nightmare. Your old boss haunts your dreams, and you find yourself repeating old habits without a second thought. Things often don't make sense! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo lets you experience the first 2 levels, giving you a taste of the game's feel, visuals, and gameplay. Find the knife and try to kill the boss!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think of it as a first-person psychological horror game with a silly twist. After getting fired and signing a new contract, you're plunged into a crazy experiment where reality blurs with nightmare. Your old boss haunts your dreams, and you find yourself repeating old habits without a second thought. Things often don't make sense! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo lets you experience the first 2 levels, giving you a taste of the game's feel, visuals, and gameplay. Find the knife and try to kill the boss!</p>",
    "short_description": "Lunatix is a funny First Person Horror game where you do work for your horrible boss and solve puzzles in a world that fades into dreams... or dreams that fade into reality?",
